   <Events> document. ADODB still holds the export's bytes: the wevtutil /c: cap bounds those.
   The export is read BYTE-EXACT (charset iso-8859-1 = windows-1252: 256 bytes -> 256 distinct chars) and decoded per
   slice (utf8Run): exports can hold invalid UTF-8 - wevtutil wrote raw cp1252 quotes from a task description on a real
